  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AutoByteus/autobyteus-nfs/zipball/v0.2.0",
  "body": "# AutoByteus NFS v0.2.0 \u2014 local setup dashboard\n\n- Start a standalone local setup interface with `autobyteus-nfs server` or `autobyteus-nfs client` from the same executable.\n- Share a folder or paste connection details, review the exact plan, and approve setup. Administrator authentication stays in the launching terminal, never the browser.\n- Inspect saved configuration separately from fresh readiness, reconnect or resume incomplete setup, and safely disconnect only after users are drained.\n- Browse directories with keyboard-friendly, draft-preserving selection. Closing management does not disconnect storage; existing CLI and service behavior remain available.\n\nSupported native host contracts remain macOS26+ and Ubuntu24.04, private trusted-network NFS, one attachment per installation. No application dependency, remote management, new platform qualification, automatic upgrade or data migration is introduced.\n\n\n\nField validation: shared-filesystem/physical and user testing is deferred. Distribution and signature checks are not field qualification. Postpublication testing and any fixes will be tracked separately; fixes use a new release.\n\n\n<!-- nfs-publication\n{\"envelope\": {\"artifactId\": 12565288864, \"digest\": \"sha256:58a6e84a5a7d397e55527b7b2549c6423db92c2041df890e739c2a1e9623d712\", \"expiresAt\": \"2027-01-22T15:36:23Z\", \"runAttempt\": 1, \"runId\": 40107739742, \"workflowCommit\": \"448cef839b4919a1e3ae0489e8d86ae36f5cee33\"}, \"payloadSha256\": \"fbde9886b6369e6ea234c951acfc820a9c04d52487f95b0a126497951216e5f0\", \"repository\": \"AutoByteus/autobyteus-nfs\", \"sourceCommit\": \"448cef839b4919a1e3ae0489e8d86ae36f5cee33\", \"version\": \"v0.2.0\"}\n-->\n"
}
